## 4. WKT：坐标和地图 SDK 的中间层

WKT 规则：

```txt
点：POINT(lng lat)
线：LINESTRING(lng1 lat1,lng2 lat2,lng3 lat3)
```

注意：一定是经度在前、纬度在后，也就是 `${lng} ${lat}`。

### 4.1 发车规划页：preview 结果转 WKT

`CreateRecordMap` 调用 `/dispatch/preview` 后：

```ts
const routes = utpAutoportPlans
  .filter(item => item?.planPath?.length > 0)
  .map(item => {
    return {
      path: `LINESTRING(${item.planPath
        .map(subItem => `${subItem?.lng} ${subItem?.lat}`)
        .join(',')})`
    };
  });

const validStaPoints = utpAutoportPlans
  .slice(0, -1)
  .filter(item => item?.utpAutoportLoc?.lng && item?.utpAutoportLoc?.lat)
  .map((item) => {
    const estimateArriveTime = formatLocalClock(item?.estimateArriveTime);
    return {
      staId: item?.utpAutoportId,
      eta: estimateArriveTime ? `${estimateArriveTime}预计到达` : '',
      wkt: `POINT(${item.utpAutoportLoc.lng} ${item.utpAutoportLoc.lat})`,
      status: 0,
      type: "POST_POINT"
    };
  });

const newInfo = [{
  staPoints: validStaPoints,
  startPoint,
  endPoint,
  routes
}];

setTrackInfo(newInfo);
```

这里会过滤掉没有 `planPath` 的路线和没有坐标的站点，避免地图渲染空覆盖物。

### 4.2 车辆详情页：运输详情转双轨迹

`DetailMap` 里：

```ts
const routes = [];
transportAutoports.forEach(item => {
  item?.planPath && routes.push({
    path: `LINESTRING(${item?.planPath
      ?.map(subItem => `${subItem?.lng} ${subItem?.lat}`)
      .join(',')})`,
    status: 0
  });
  item?.historyPath && routes.push({
    path: `LINESTRING(${item?.historyPath
      ?.map(subItem => `${subItem?.lng} ${subItem?.lat}`)
      .join(',')})`,
    status: 1
  });
});
```

`status=0` 表示未行驶规划路线，`status=1` 表示已行驶历史路线。地图样式由 `route-line-${status}` 决定。

站点：

```ts
const newInfo = [{
  staPoints: transportAutoports?.map(item => {
    const estimateArriveTime = formatLocalClock(item?.estimateArriveTime);
    return {
      staId: item?.utpAutoportId,
      eta: estimateArriveTime ? `${estimateArriveTime}预计到达` : '',
      wkt: `POINT(${item?.utpAutoportLoc?.lng} ${item?.utpAutoportLoc?.lat})`,
      status: 0,
      type: "POST_POINT"
    };
  }),
  endPoint: {
    wkt: `POINT(${transportAutoports[transportAutoports?.length - 1]?.utpAutoportLoc?.lng} ${transportAutoports[transportAutoports?.length - 1]?.utpAutoportLoc?.lat})`
  },
  routes
}];

setTrackInfo(prev => isEqual(prev, newInfo) ? prev : newInfo);
```

最后一行很关键：父页面先用 `isEqual` 拦截一次，如果轨迹数据深度相等，就复用旧 state，避免把相同数据继续传给地图组件。

### 4.3 独立地图页：当前车辆定位

`MapView` 里如果接口返回 `nowLoc`：

```ts
vehiclePoint = {
  wkt: `POINT(${nowLoc.lng} ${nowLoc.lat})`,
  vehicleId: String(udid),
  status: CarStatus.Driving,
  etaAtNextSta: '',
  vehicleImgUrl: VEHICLE_MARKER_PNG_URL,
  angle: nowLoc.heading || 0,
  markerType: 'car-marker-current',
};

setMapCenter([nowLoc.lng, nowLoc.lat]);
```

车辆图标还带了 `angle`，`CarMarker` 里会按朝向旋转图标。

