## 6. WKT 到 AMap 覆盖物

本地地图适配层 `src/vendors/alife-yz-map-next/index.ts` 提供：

```ts
export function wktToOverlay(
  wkt: string,
  id: string,
  data: any,
  type: string,
  customOptions?: any
): any { ... }
```

### 6.1 POINT 转 Marker

```ts
const pointMatch = wkt.match(/POINT\s*\(\s*([\d.]+)\s+([\d.]+)\s*\)/i);
if (pointMatch) {
  const lng = parseFloat(pointMatch[1]);
  const lat = parseFloat(pointMatch[2]);

  const marker = new AMap.Marker({
    position: [lng, lat],
    zIndex: config.zIndex || 100,
    offset: config.offset ? new AMap.Pixel(config.offset[0], config.offset[1]) : undefined,
    anchor: config.anchor as any,
    content: config.content,
  });

  marker._data = data;
  marker._id = id;
  return marker;
}
```

### 6.2 LINESTRING 转 Polyline

```ts
const lineMatch = wkt.match(/LINESTRING\s*\(([^)]+)\)/i);
if (lineMatch) {
  const coords = lineMatch[1].split(',').map((coord) => {
    const [lng, lat] = coord.trim().split(/\s+/);
    return [parseFloat(lng), parseFloat(lat)];
  });

  const polyline = new AMap.Polyline({
    path: coords,
    strokeColor: polylineConfig.strokeColor || '#1890ff',
    strokeWeight: polylineConfig.strokeWeight || 6,
    strokeOpacity: polylineConfig.strokeOpacity || 1,
    borderWeight: polylineConfig.borderWeight || 2,
    isOutline: polylineConfig.isOutline || true,
    outlineColor: polylineConfig.outlineColor || '#808080',
    lineCap: polylineConfig.lineCap || 'round',
    lineJoin: polylineConfig.lineJoin || 'round',
    zIndex: polylineConfig.zIndex || 100,
  });

  return polyline;
}
```

面试可以这样讲：WKT 是前端内部协议，父页面统一生成，地图适配层统一解析，这样业务页面不用直接依赖 AMap Marker / Polyline 构造参数。

