## 8. 核心渲染：renderOverlays

`DeliveryMap` 的渲染函数：

```ts
const renderOverlays = (data: TrajectoryInfo[]) => {
  const $map = Map.getInstance();

  const overlaysArr = data.map((item) => {
    const {
      carPoints = [],
      routes = [],
      staPoints = [],
      endPoint,
      startPoint,
    } = item;

    ...
  });

  overlaysArr.filter(Boolean).forEach((overlays) => {
    overlays.filter(Boolean).forEach((overlay) => {
      $map.add(overlay);
    });
  });
};
```

### 8.1 站点编号 Marker

```ts
const staNoMarkers = staPoints
  .filter((o) => Boolean(o?.wkt))
  .map((staPoint, index) => {
    return wktToOverlay(
      staPoint.wkt,
      `${staPoint.staId}_${index}`,
      staPoint,
      'sta-marker-no',
      (staPoint.type || StopOverPointType.PICK_POINT) === StopOverPointType.PICK_POINT
        ? { content: `<span ... color: #097562 ...>${index + 1}</span>` }
        : { content: `<span ... color: #005be5 ...>${index + 1}</span>` }
    );
  });
```

这里按站点类型区分编号颜色：

- `PICK_POINT`：绿色系，表示揽收。
- 其他任务点：蓝色系，表示派送 / 途经。

### 8.2 车辆 Marker

```ts
const carMarker = carPoints
  .filter((o) => Boolean(o?.wkt))
  .map((carPoint) => {
    return wktToOverlay(
      carPoint.wkt,
      carPoint.vehicleId,
      carPoint,
      carPoint.markerType ||
        `car-marker-${carPoint.status === CarStatus.Driving ? 'normal' : 'offset'}`,
      {
        content: transformJsxToHtml(<CarMarker data={carPoint} />),
      }
    );
  });
```

`CarMarker` 是 React 组件，但高德 Marker 的 `content` 要 HTML 字符串，所以用：

```ts
transformJsxToHtml(<CarMarker data={carPoint} />)
```

适配层内部用 `ReactDOMServer.renderToStaticMarkup` 转成字符串。这是 React 和非 React 地图 SDK 的桥接。

车辆朝向：

```tsx
transform: `translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(${markerAngle + 130}deg)`
```

`angle` 来自 `nowLoc.heading` 或 `vehiclePoseVO.heading`。

### 8.3 路线 Polyline

```ts
const routeLines = routes
  .filter((o) => Boolean(o?.path))
  .map((route, index) => {
    return wktToOverlay(
      route.path,
      route.subRecordId || `route-line-${route.status}-${index}`,
      route,
      `route-line-${route.status}`
    );
  });
```

通过 `route.status` 拼样式 key，渲染逻辑不写死颜色，颜色都在 `addOverlayConfig` 管。

