## 12. 中心点阈值：避免 GPS 微小漂移

独立地图页会传 `center` 给 `DeliveryMap`：

```tsx
<DeliveryMap
  trajectoryInfo={trackInfo}
  graphBubbleInfo={graphBubbleInfo}
  vehicleId={udid as string}
  businessAreaId={businessAreaId}
  center={mapCenter}
/>
```

`DeliveryMap` 里：

```ts
useEffect(() => {
  if (!mapInitialized || !center) return;
  const map = (window as any)._amap_instance;
  if (!map) return;

  const prev = prevCenterRef.current;
  const threshold = 0.0001;
  if (
    prev &&
    Math.abs(center[0] - prev[0]) < threshold &&
    Math.abs(center[1] - prev[1]) < threshold
  ) {
    return;
  }
  prevCenterRef.current = center;
  map.setCenter(center, true);
}, [mapInitialized, center]);
```

`0.0001` 经纬度大约是 10 米量级。车辆 GPS 会有小范围浮动，如果每次都居中，用户会看到地图轻微抖动。阈值判断可以过滤掉无意义的中心点更新。

